<title>SINGAPORE: Straits Trading 1st-half net up 10.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Straits Trading 1st-half net up 10.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			     16.31 vs   14.77</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)		     5.5  vs    5.0</p>
<p>    Turnover				101.38 vs   64.01</p>
<p>    Investment income		    12.23 vs   14.17</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     12.23 vs    8.33</p>
<p>    Interest (expense)		    1.04 vs    1.66</p>
<p>    Depreciation			    2.09 vs    1.67</p>
<p>    Profits from associates	     4.31 vs    3.62</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			 24.45 vs   22.47</p>
<p>    Tax					 8.13 vs    7.70</p>
<p>    Extraordinary gain		    3.31 vs   12.91</p>
<p>Note - Straits Trading Co Ltd is an investment company with interests in tin smelting, trading, property holding and development.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
</text>
